<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.00/1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.00/1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$1.00-1.50 lower. Top $53.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   235-260 lbs mostly 53.00, filled out a load at 53.50</p>
<p>	   250-270 lbs	  52.50-53.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   270-290 lbs	  51.00-52.00</p>
<p>		 295 lbs	  50.50</p>
<p>US 1-2   210-225 lbs	  50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to 1.00 lower, decline on weights under 500 lbs.</p>
<p>Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2   300-500 lbs    43.50</p>
<p>US 1-3   500-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
